{"title":"2015 Final tour - Azerbaijan in lower age category","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/4/b846fe39bbbbda2060c9588045adabc8ec9a202c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{1.}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> are positive real numbers such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/3/883913946f009d61a812e11b8ef42b25551815e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$abc=\\frac{1}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"64\" height=\"38\" />. Prove\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/9/b097ce02bc952bfa7b1fcbb21c364c4422695029.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^2+b^2+c^2+a^2\\cdot b^2+a^2\\cdot c^2+b^2\\cdot c^2 \\geq \\frac{15}{16}\\]\" width=\"337\" height=\"38\" />       \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/11830454a66e52bab861d86097d83e0e557f9261.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textit{(2 points)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"73\" height=\"18\" />                                                             \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/8/488c5f2bf5d593b6dfc0702498a1c39164b1a2fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{2.}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> are sides of a triangle. Prove that the area of triangle isn't more than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/9/bd9043129a6ad5302176922417ea695982a7a39f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{(a^2+b^2+c^2)}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"112\" height=\"41\" />.   \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/2/0a28c40c0bfb19996df86c5aacd913a388764a7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textit{(4 points)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"73\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/c/adc3b334fcde1762c1d6d09a071f3392b8b5d794.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{3.}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" /> Find all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/f/6efaaf74e576202fad965134bc49c6a34aac4c30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> polynomials that have real coefficients, which for all real numbers of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> this equation must be true:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/3/50306e0b8c3034440d78fef9f29d1068607a6c24.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[P(P(x))=(x^2+x+1)\\cdot P(x)\\]\" width=\"237\" height=\"20\" />                                                                                                                   <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/e/36e4c4ca534fa3549abd52d2299a600097d59062.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textit{(6 points)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"73\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/0/ab01b8f7f55b81f5313763673ba99bb13a9154d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{4.}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" /> Natural number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> natural divisors. If sum of this divisors is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/9/3a94f5469768149a2e4ee75f80c05f61e0a92fee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3500$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" />, find all numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" />.     \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/5/1b5ba0c29eeaa3fa6a9820d10a69747c757483fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textit{(8 points)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"73\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/5/0b528c99159f06df36f22377c4b73faa5c4f701b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{5.}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> is convex quadrilateral. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/a/92aa9683d635ff7e60d70268477142f1a46bb755.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\angle BAD = 90^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"125\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/5/805dcc6726aeb57b034d804b5f9f6977d5a66b22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\angle BAC = 2\\angle BDC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"164\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/5/8d5c66970c3b5179ac06822429d8300e777698ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\angle DBA + m\\angle DBC = 180^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"229\" height=\"16\" />. Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/3/8539ba6269ece2639f4c864393551c982ac3edc0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\angle DBA$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"75\" height=\"14\" />.     \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/5/a7580574838d90461a0f98043baadb9fe639585c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textit{(10 points)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"81\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017112809\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.019 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 94/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5616/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:14285:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017112809 and revision id 237139. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}